{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16978","headline":"夏日陪冯许二侍郎与严秘书游昊天观览旧题寄同里杨华州中丞 · 武元衡","name":"夏日陪冯许二侍郎与严秘书游昊天观览旧题寄同里杨华州中丞","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"三伏草木变，九城车马烦。\n碧霄回骑射，丹洞入桃源。\n台殿云浮栋，緌缨鹤在轩。\n莫将真破妄，聊用静持喧。\n石甃古苔冷，水筠凉簟翻。\n黄公垆下叹，旌斾国东门。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"武元衡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_16978.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16978","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}